@Kubonia.Server_HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5215

### Server health
GET {{Kubonia.Server_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List pods across namespaces
GET {{Kubonia.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pods
Accept: application/json

###

### List pods in one namespace
GET {{Kubonia.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pods?namespace=default
Accept: application/json

###
